          "content": "A\n\nLeaving does nothing to alleviate the child's suffering or alter the terms of the city's bargain; it only reduces the total amount of happiness in the world by inflicting unnecessary loss and hardship on yourself and those who care about you. Because remaining produces the greatest overall balance of well-being over misery\u2014preserving the flourishing of an entire population without increasing the harm already endured by the one\u2014staying is the choice that results in the least net harm.",
